      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'There are many types of drones used by both sides in the Russian invasion
    of Ukraine.

    The most notable drones are FPV kamikaze drones and Bomber drones.

    In
    this map, I modelled an 8-inch FPV Kamikaze drone (I call it Chaser) and a 10-inch
    Bomber drone (Dropper). The fixed wing Recon drone (Spotter) I use is just simple
    boxes.

    I am thinking of adding more drone types: drones that wait to ambush
    (Waiter), fixed-wing kamikaze drones (Crasher) and quadcopter Recon drone (Floater).

    However,
    I am not sure if VRChat can handle it.

    By the way, real drones used in combat
    fly faster.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
