  m_text: 'Initially, the map size was 500 x 500 m, but I realised that it would
    be too big so it is now 100 x 100 m.

    I wanted to add more terrain features
    to this map, such as trenches, houses and destroyed vehicles.

    However, I
    could not find free models that were suitable for this map.

    This map does
    not cheat. A drone has to spot a player first before any attacking drone is deployed.
    The AI does not know where the player is. The AI has to search for players realistically.


    Lastly,
    I love vibe coding with Claude AI.'
